Column name: total_30_day_fill_count_ge65 Type: FLOAT64 Description: The number of Medicare Part D standardized 30-day fills for beneficiaries age 65 and older. The standardized 30-day fill is derived from the number of days supplied on each Part D claim divided by 30. Standardized 30-day fill values less than 1.0 were bottom-coded with a value of 1.0 and standardized 30-day fill values greater than 12.0 were top-coded with a value of 12.0.
